[[Amulet of the Wild]] is an [[Accessory]] normally obtained by buying the [[Unidentified Amulet]]. After some time, it triggers the [[Pet]] next to it and gives 4 {{icon/spikes}}. It also raises the return damage limit of {{icon/spikes}} against [[Melee]] and [[Ranged]] weapons.

The "return damage limit" refers to how much of the opponent's weapon damage can be returned provided you have enough {{icon/spikes}}. Normally the limit for melee weapons is 100% of the damage, and for ranged weapons 0% of the damage. Having an Amulet of the Wild will change that to 150% and 50% respectively.

Example:
{| class="styled"
|+ Spike return damage limit +50%
! Spike count
! Melee damage
! Spike damage
|-
| 10
| 4
| 6
|-
| 10
| 9
| 10
|}

The [[Amulet of the Wild]] is great in a {{icon/spikes}} build, since it gives a large amount of {{icon/spikes}} and improves their properties in general. It also force-triggers a [[Pet]], which is amazing with slower pets like [[Shelly]] or [[Turtle]].
